// =============================================================================
// (2026-07-20) The `WorkspacePersonaProfile` model (table
// `workspace_persona_profiles`) was removed with the workspace-persona /
// workflow-personalization / operational-density feature. The forward
// migration drops the table. The `Team.personaProfile` relation was
