  // R7-reviewer-workspace additive — Phase 2A coding-schema service requires:
  //   * status  — lifecycle status (DRAFT / ACTIVE / ARCHIVED). Separate from `state` because legacy schemas
  //               used `state` for the workflow state; the new admin UI exposes `status` as the user-facing label.
  //   * label   — display name on coding-schemas admin page (separate from the URL-safe `slug`).
