  // R7-governance: relaxed to nullable — Phase 4A governance-policy.service writes `scope` (R7-additive)
  // as the canonical scope-kind. `scopeKind` remains for legacy reads. PROJECTION fallback:
  // `scope ?? scopeKind`. ENFORCEMENT unchanged: policy-evaluation engine reads the coalesced scope;
  // composite unique @@unique([policyId, scope, scopeTargetId]) ensures one assignment per tuple.
  scopeKind         String?  @map("scope_kind") @db.VarChar(40)
  scopeTargetId     String   @map("scope_target_id") @db.Uuid
  // R7 additive — aliases + extras
  scope             String   @db.VarChar(40)
